      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, it's got a good tone. But looking at the draft, the \"richness\" score is actually a bit lower than I was hoping for. I know I said not to game it, but if the description is too sparse, it might not capture the full scale of the property for the high-end clients. \n\nCan you try an expanded version? Give me more detail on the sensory experience—the marble, the view, the beach. Just make sure it stays professional; I really don't want it to look like a shopping list of adjectives, but it does need to feel very \"full\" and lush.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
